1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:01,194
Frankenstein,

2
00:00:01,194 --> 00:00:03,299
monster paling terkenal di dunia...

3
00:00:03,299 --> 00:00:05,488
lahir gara-gara gunung di Indonesia!

4
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:08,199
Tambora meletus terdahsyat dalam sejarah.

5
00:00:08,199 --> 00:00:09,716
Setahun kemudian...

6
00:00:09,716 --> 00:00:11,678
Eropa kehilangan musim panas.

7
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:15,005
Hujan badai mengurung Lord
Byron di sebuah vila di Swiss.

8
00:00:15,005 --> 00:00:16,009
Byron menantang:

9
00:00:16,009 --> 00:00:18,009
siapa bisa menulis cerita paling seram?

10
00:00:18,009 --> 00:00:18,626
Mary Shelley,

11
00:00:18,626 --> 00:00:20,104
18 tahun...

12
00:00:20,104 --> 00:00:21,858
mulai menulis Frankenstein.

13
00:00:21,858 --> 00:00:23,251
Dari tantangan itu,

14
00:00:23,251 --> 00:00:25,896
lahir juga cerita vampir modern pertama!

15
00:00:25,896 --> 00:00:26,787
Percaya nggak,

16
00:00:26,787 --> 00:00:28,427
Frankenstein lahir dari Tambora?

17
00:00:28,427 --> 00:00:29,988
Tulis di komentar!
